{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261115/photo/bkn-20261115141315638-1115_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261115141315\"/><p>貨車橫亘路中。</p><p>赤鱲角發生交通意外。今晨(15日)9時許，一輛密斗貨車沿順朗路往九龍方向行駛，期間失事翻側，司機及跟車工人受輕傷，自行爬出車外。救援人員接報到場，為司機及跟車工人初步治理後，二人毋須送院。貨車橫亘路中，期間上址交通受阻，意外原因有待調查。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-15T06:36:36.321126+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":135,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-15T06:13:15+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-15T06:50:31.131576+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-15T06:30:17.251386+00:00","content_hash":"a2c5c1bb96836acf08e3d6be70f053af971cb51f789101a936a3ecc7774a5bd3","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}